# The Messages shot: a channel with a conversation in it.
#
# One frame rather than a clip, because this is the still the README and the Pak Store listing
# carry - so it is the one scene here whose last frame is the point. The channel thread rather
# than the conversation list: bubbles either side of the panel, an outbound one carrying its
# delivery mark, and the separators a log that crosses a day boundary earns.
scene demo
scale 4
config
key down 1
key a
